            <div xml:id="d1056">

                <pb facs="1014" n="1002" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg1002"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890E.01/205: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Diplomatic Agent and Consul General at Beirut</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Wadsworth</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beirut</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-08T17:00:00+02:00">November 8, 1943—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 8—3:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>305. Reference my 302, November 5, 8 p.m. Lebanese Chamber today voted
                    unanimously Government’s bill amending constitution.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wadsworth</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
